{
  "A loading overlay for a container or the whole page. It includes a shade, a panel with the kit spinner and a message, and a Cancel button when the operation can be stopped. The content underneath is unavailable while it is shown, and focus returns afterward.": "",
  "Covering a container": "",
  "`target` specifies the component or element to cover. `value` or `x-model` shows and hides the panel, or you can call `show()` and `hide()`. `delay` keeps it from flashing during quick operations.": "",
  "Covering the page, with Cancel": "",
  "Shade, panel and indicator": "",
  "The panel is placed inside the container, above its content. The container gets `aria-busy`, and the content under the panel is inert, so it cannot be clicked or focused.": "",
  "Without a `target`, the panel covers the viewport and the rest of the page is inert.": "",
  "Focus moves from the content underneath to the panel (to the Cancel button if there is one) and returns to its original position when the panel hides.": "",
  "Quick operations show nothing. The panel appears after `delay`, and hiding it before then cancels it.": "",
  "The kit spinner can cover a container with a single call (`Spinner.cover`). LoadPanel is the full component, with the panel, message, delay and button.": "",
  "A `status` region. The message is announced when the panel appears and when it changes.": "",
  "Decorative. The message describes what is happening.": "",
  "`inert` and `aria-busy`, so screen readers skip the content and it cannot receive clicks or focus.": "",
  "A kit button named in the kit language. Escape activates it.": "",
  "The layer. `data-shade`, `data-pane`, `data-page`.": "Katman. `data-shade`, `data-pane`, `data-page`.",
  "The panel.": "",
  "The spinner, the message and the button.": "Spinner, ileti ve düğme.",
  "Units: the layer (`shaded`), the panel (`shown`) and the message.": "",
  "Place: the appearance of the Cancel button (`variant`).": "",
  "The minimum distance to the edge of the covered area, and the space between the indicator, message and button.": "",
  "The area to cover, a component or element. `null` covers the whole page.": "",
  "The message below the indicator. This is the same property as `text`.": "",
  "Indicates whether the panel is shown. `x-model` provides two-way binding.": "",
  "The delay in milliseconds before it appears. Hiding it before then shows nothing.": "",
  "Dims the covered area.": "",
  "Shows the box behind the indicator and the message.": "",
  "Shows the rotating indicator (the kit spinner).": "",
  "Shows a Cancel button in the panel. Escape activates it too.": "",
  "The kit string “Cancel”": "",
  "The button text.": "",
  "Clicking the shade hides the panel.": "",
  "Occur when the panel appears (after its delay) and when it is hidden.": "",
  "Occurs when the Cancel button or Escape is pressed. The panel hides afterward.": "",
  "Programmatic control. `show()` returns `false` while the panel is shown or waiting for its delay.": "",
  "Indicates whether the panel is currently on screen.": "",
  "The kit spinner and button in the panel.": ""
